HobbyCAD is a 3D CAD application aimed at hobbyist use, built on the
OpenCASCADE modeling kernel with a Qt6 interface and the SolveSpace
constraint solver (libslvs) for sketching.

STATUS OF THIS PORT

It is not submittable to dports as written. Two dependencies are missing:

  cad/opencascade   dports carries 7.8.1; HobbyCAD needs 8.0.1, and 8.0.1
                    does not build on any BSD without the consolidated
                    platform fixes carried in the 8.0.1+p1 tarball.

  cad/libslvs       no port exists. SolveSpace ships libslvs only as part
                    of the application; HobbyCAD uses the 3.2p1 snapshot
                    with a fatal-error handler added.

Both would have to land before this port means anything.

WWW: https://github.com/ayourk/HobbyCAD
